  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, when the craven uses a Profession or Craft check to earn money with one week’s worth of work, he gains twice the result of his Profession or Craft check in gold (rather than just the check’s result in gold). At 7th level, he gains 5 times his Profession or Craft checks, and at 11th level, he gains 10 times his Profession or Craft checks. Finally, at 15th level, he earns 100 times his level on such checks. This does not provide any other sort of bonus to Profession or Craft checks.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-craven#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
